# Privacy Policy

**Comment to Video** respects your privacy.

- We collect only the minimum data needed to deliver replies, including your username and notification preferences.
- We do **not** store or analyze your comments or videos.
- We do **not** track your activity across other websites.
- We do **not** sell, share, or monetize your data in any form.
- Notifications are processed only when you tag the bot.
- You can request deletion of your data at any time by contacting us at: `your@email.com`.

By using Comment to Video, you agree to this privacy policy.  
Any future updates will be published on this page.

